  "caveats": "Fusion TP carries only SPX 5-min intraday RV. NDX and DJI have no intraday source in this repository, so the per-asset arm uses a daily r^2 proxy. The proxy is noisier than 5-min RV, which structurally caps macro-F1; this is a data limit, not an arm failure. Date window matched to the fusion TP (2005-01-03 to 2026-05-29) so fold sizes and embargo are comparable."
